+[4.8GB]▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓ KERNEL PAGE TABLES (swapper_pg_dir @ 0x136DEB000)
+[5GB]  ░░░░░░░░ More RAM
+[6GB]  (end of file)
+
+Legend: █ = RAM with linear mapping  ░ = Regular RAM  ▓ = Kernel structures
 ```
\ No newline at end of file
