+|7FE00.0000     |                   |            | <--  | scan line |      _/              
+|               |                   |  RPM cache |      | image fill|    _/                
+|_______________|                   |            | -->  .___________.  _/                  
+  	                                .____________.                                         
+                                                        .-----------.                      
